# core.autocrlf=true on this Windows checkout would give these files CRLF
# endings. A shell script with CRLF fails on Linux with a "bad interpreter"
# error naming a path that looks correct, which is a miserable thing to debug
# during an incident — and these are exactly the files an incident needs.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
